# Vector-space contract comparability core complete (violation finder). A
# gmeow:VectorSpaceContract whose v1-mandatory comparability core is INCOMPLETE — it
# omits any of the family anchor gmeow:effectiveOfFamily, the effective/prefix
# dimension gmeow:embeddingDimensions, the metric gmeow:distanceMetric, or the
# per-prefix normalization gmeow:normalizationKind. These three space-level axes plus
# the family anchor are the properties two vectors must share to be comparable, so
# each is individually required rather than merely folded into the digest. Independent
# SPARQL twin of that requiredness (allValuesFrom carrier + class-scoped ClosureEntry,
# lowered to sh:minCount 1) — the live, reasoning-independent check of the same
# invariant the derived SHACL surface enforces. Empty over a scene whose every
# effective space names all four; non-empty over a contract missing one.
PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>

SELECT ?vsc WHERE {
  ?vsc a gmeow:VectorSpaceContract .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS {
    ?vsc gmeow:effectiveOfFamily   ?fam ;
         gmeow:embeddingDimensions ?dim ;
         gmeow:distanceMetric      ?metric ;
         gmeow:normalizationKind   ?norm .
  }
}
ORDER BY ?vsc
